{# Decision template: which strategy one NPC in a SexLab mini-game scene starts using right now, as one choice
   over the strategies the engine allows. Sent by SkyrimNet_SexLab.dll (StrategyDecision.cpp) through
   PublicSendCustomDecisionToLLM: for every NPC when the scene starts, for the speaker after each line an
   NPC in the scene speaks, and for an NPC asked, ordered or punished: sent after that NPC's LLM reply to the
   narration (its thought, or a 20 s timeout), replacing the dialogue decision for that reply; an ask / order
   answer is narrated by the game as its own line afterwards. Rendered into a decisions request, never into chat
   messages.

   Context pushed by the game (C++ snapshot): trigger (scene_start | dialogue | asked | ordered | punished),
   focus_uuid, focus_name, last_line_text (the ask / order narration, the spoken line, or for a punishment
   "<act>. <feeling>, because <reason>."; above 80% torture the game makes the focus submit without asking),
   role, arousal, orgasms, expects_orgasm, timeline [lines, oldest first: speech, thoughts, narrations and other
   events of the focus actor, narration inside speech on its own line], partners [uuid, name, is_player, role,
   arousal, orgasms, relationship, relationship_rank], options [key, text], current_key (the options key in use,
   set only when punished; "" otherwise), ordered_key (the options key the punisher orders the focus to take; "" for
   no order), latest_thought (the focus actor's newest thought; "" when none).
   The current strategy is shown only for a punishment. Keys are read back by the game: keep {{ o.key }} as given.
   A criterion is one line; profiles and other multi-line decorators belong in the state blocks. #}
{% set _focus = decnpc(focus_uuid) %}
{% set _dom_slave = is_plugin_loaded("SkyrimNet_DOM.esp") and is_in_faction(focus_uuid, "DOMPlayerSlaveFaction") %}
[ state focus ]
{{ focus_name }}, {{ _focus.gender }} {{ _focus.race }}, is the {{ role }} in this scene{% if not expects_orgasm %} (this act is not expected to bring {{ focus_name }} to orgasm){% endif %}.
{{ focus_name }} is {{ arousal }}{% if orgasms > 0 %} and has climaxed {{ orgasms }} time{% if orgasms > 1 %}s{% endif %} so far{% endif %}.
{{ render_character_profile("short_inline", focus_uuid) }}
[ end state ]

{% if _dom_slave %}
{% set _dom_npc.UUID = focus_uuid %}
{% set _dom_npc.name = focus_name %}
{% set _dom_args.npc = _dom_npc %}
[ state dom_instructions ]
{{ render_template("submodules\\user_final_instructions\\0551_dom_instructions", _dom_args) }}
[ end state ]

{% endif %}
[ state scene ]
{% set _sexlab = sexlab_get_threads(focus_uuid) %}
{% if existsIn(_sexlab, "threads") %}
{% for thread in _sexlab.threads %}
{% for actor_record in thread.actors %}
{% if to_number(actor_record.uuid) == focus_uuid %}
{% if existsIn(thread, "location") and thread.location != "" %}On {{ thread.location }}, {% endif %}{{ thread.description }}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
[ end state ]

[ state partners ]
{% for p in partners %}
{{ p.name }}: the {{ p.role }}, {{ p.arousal }}{% if p.orgasms > 0 %}, climaxed {{ p.orgasms }} time{% if p.orgasms > 1 %}s{% endif %}{% endif %}. {{ focus_name }} and {{ p.name }} are {{ p.relationship }}.
- {{ render_character_profile("short_inline", p.uuid) }}
{% endfor %}
[ end state ]

[ state timeline ]
{% if length(timeline) > 0 %}
{% for line in timeline %}
{{ line }}
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
Nothing has happened yet.
{% endif %}
[ end state ]

{% if latest_thought != "" %}
[ state latest_thought ]
{{ focus_name }}'s most recent thought: "{{ latest_thought }}"
[ end state ]

{% endif %}
[ state last_line ]
{% if trigger == "punished" %}{{ last_line_text }}
{% if ordered_key != "" %}{{ focus_name }} is being punished for what they are doing now{% if current_key != "" %} (`{{ current_key }}`){% endif %} and is ordered to change to `{{ ordered_key }}`. Obeying may make it stop; anything else invites more punishment.{% else if current_key != "" %}{{ focus_name }} is being punished for what they are doing now (`{{ current_key }}`). Keeping it invites more punishment; changing it may make it stop.{% else %}{{ focus_name }} is being punished for what they are doing now; changing it may make it stop.{% endif %}
{% else if trigger == "asked" or trigger == "ordered" %}{{ last_line_text }}{% else if trigger == "dialogue" and last_line_text != "" %}{{ focus_name }} just said: "{{ last_line_text }}"{% else %}The scene has just begun; {{ focus_name }} has not spoken during it yet.{% endif %}
[ end state ]

[ question strategy choice ]
Decide which strategy {{ focus_name }} decides to start using right now.
{% if _dom_slave %}Follow `dom_instructions` for how {{ focus_name }} obeys and feels; it outweighs their usual preferences.
{% endif %}Base it on their relationship with each partner (`partners`), what is happening (`scene`), and what {{ focus_name }} has thought, said and experienced (`timeline`).
In order of importance: {% if latest_thought != "" %}`latest_thought` (what {{ focus_name }} really decided), {% endif %}`last_line`, {{ focus_name }}'s other thoughts, and recent events over older events.
{% if trigger == "asked" or trigger == "ordered" or trigger == "punished" %}{{ focus_name }} has already answered this in `timeline` (the newest speech and thought): choose the strategy that matches that answer.
{% endif %} {{ focus_name }}'s words are more about changing other people's behavior than describing {{ focus_name }}'s own desires.
A victim who is resisting does not cooperate. A lover or friend who is lagging behind may be helped. A rival or enemy is unlikely to be generous.
{% if trigger == "punished" %}
After a punishment, decide whether {{ focus_name }} gives in and {% if ordered_key != "" %}obeys by choosing `{{ ordered_key }}`{% else %}changes{% endif %}, or defies and keeps {% if current_key != "" %}`{{ current_key }}`{% else %}what they are doing{% endif %}. Defiance gets rarer with each punishment in `timeline`; someone who fears or serves the punisher usually gives in.
{% endif %}
[ criteria ]
{% for o in options %}
{{ o.key }}: {{ o.text }}
{% endfor %}
[ end criteria ]
[ end question ]
